Subject: [PATCH 10/10] =?UTF-8?q?OP-07=20S7=20=C2=B7=20Guardado=20protegid?=
 =?UTF-8?q?o=20en=20F0.2b:=20Core.saveGate=20entre=20la=20revisi=C3=B3n=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?confirmada=20y=20la=20siguiente,=20con=20la=20intenci=C3=B3n=20?=
